  "description": "Yang Kye-Soo and Yun Myeong-Tae are meant to be. Or at least, that’s what Kye-Soo had always thought. With Myeong-Tae following him around and practically begging for his attention since elementary school, how could he ever get the wrong idea? So when the burly boy babbles off a list of qualities for his ideal boyfriend, Kye-Soo is left shocked and stunned - because not one of them applies to him! In order to become the man of Myeong-Tae’s dreams, Kye-Soo enlists the help of the campus’s captain of charm, the sexily seductive Kang Shin-Joo. With Shin-Joo’s guidance, Kye-Soo will do his best to learn the tricks of the trade and reel Myeong-Tae in hook, line, and sinker! \n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
